      "help_en": "The node type. Valid values:\n\nSTAND_ALONE: standalone\nMASTER_SLAVE (default): high availability (master-replica)",
      "help_zh": "节点类型，取值：\nSTAND_ALONE：单副本。\nMASTER_SLAVE（默认）：高可用（双副本）",
