      "example": "[{\"RegionId\": \"cn-hangzhou\",\"ZoneId\": \"cn-hangzhou-b\",\"ShardClass\": \"tair.scm.with.proxy.standard.2m.8d\",\"ShardCount\": \"3\",\"Period\": \"1\",\"Quantity\": \"1\"}]",
      "help_en": "If you want to query cloud-native read/write splitting instances, Tair ESSD-based instances, or instances of different specifications, you must specify this parameter as a JSON string. For more information, see the Additional description of the Instances parameter section",
      "help_zh": "当您需要查询云原生版读写分离架构、Tair ESSD型实例或多个不同规格的实例时，需要传入本参数，为JSON格式字符串，更多信息请参见下方的Instances参数补充说明",
